  dialogueNodes:
  - nodeID: Intro
    dialogueLines:
    - Whats that? Your looking for a job to earn some gold?
    - Well, lucky for you, we do have a small problem up north of the city.
    - A small tribe of Goblins have been causing trouble in the forest.
    - The city guards have their hands tied with other trouble at the moment.
    - If you could take care of the issue, the guards watch will be sure to repay
      you.
